  "name": "dragonfly",
  "_about": "A dragonfly, 7-8 cm long with a 10 cm span: a long thin abdomen of ten segments (a dark ring at each joint, the claspers at its tip), a deep slanted thorax with pale shoulder stripes, a small head that is nearly all eye (the two great compound eyes meeting on top), six thin legs folded forward under the thorax, and four long glassy wings, veins fanning from each root and a dark pterostigma near each tip, beating fast (the hind pair half a beat behind the fore). It darts low and only over water (index.html keeps it to the lake shore and the river, `fly`: its height above the water, its speed, its wingbeat). SCULPTED (2026-11-07: generator scratchpad sc/sea2/gen/dragonfly.py; the overlay written at k = 1, scaled by k through `sculptScale`) for the asset manager; the game draws it as its parts, in the instanced herd (instanced.js) -- at its size the parts read the same.",
